  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryBook
  title: The Island of the Great Library
  paragraph: The *fox* lived near a quiet *river*. Every morning he went out to *explore*.
    He loved to find new things. His *friends* would join his *adventures*. Together
    they had so much *fun*.
